{# mini-cart — storefront-rendering spec §5.2/§9/§10: "a stable, cacheable shell; contents
   hydrate via GET /_shop/cart (JSON, no-store); a plain /cart link without JS." The count/lines/
   total below are ALWAYS rendered empty/zero server-side (so this block never bypasses the page
   cache with visitor-specific data) — shop.js fetches the real cart on every page load and
   repaints them, and again after every cart mutation elsewhere on the page. #}
{# data-shop-scope (storefront-v1 spec §5): EVERY shop block root emits the opaque wishlist
   storage scope — OMITTED entirely (never empty) when the seam answers null — so hearts
   hydrated inside a route-less BUILDER page find their store from the nearest root, with no
   metadata fetch. The scope is deterministic within an already tenant-segmented page cache. #}
{% set wishlist_scope = shop_wishlist_scope() %}
<div class="thallo-block thallo-block-mini-cart" data-shop-mini-cart{% if wishlist_scope %} data-shop-scope="{{ wishlist_scope }}"{% endif %}>
  {# Icon button with a corner count badge (the standard storefront pattern). The SVG is
     commerce-owned inline (shopping bag, fill: currentColor so it follows the theme) —
     no cross-pack icon dependency — and aria-hidden; the sr-only span keeps the
     accessible name. No id attribute: this block may render more than once per page. #}
  <button type="button" class="thallo-block-mini-cart__toggle" data-shop-cart-toggle
          aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="thallo-mini-cart-panel">
    {# width/height are the PRE-CSS intrinsic size: the stylesheet link renders after
       this markup (blocks cannot reach <head>), and a dimensionless SVG paints huge
       until shop.css arrives. CSS still owns the final size. #}
    <svg class="thallo-block-mini-cart__icon" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
         aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
